<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-306] Note actions are difficult to reach when notes have too many paragraph</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-306</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently note actions are difficult to reach is page is long enough.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In current UX user has to scroll back up if he wants to access note actions, and then scroll back down, where (s)he was.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
